# `rw serve` writes runtime state here while the e2e suite runs. Prettier 3
# does read .gitignore, but only the one beside its working directory — the
# entry that ignores this path is the .gitignore rw writes *inside* the .rw
# directory itself, which Prettier never sees. Without this, `make format`
# rewrites the JSON of a live server and CI's `prettier --check .` fails on a
# generated file. Matched anywhere, since the data dir name is not configurable.
**/.rw/
